    19	We are applying for the Available, Functional, and Reusable badges. Reasons are:
    20	
    21	[(1) The Benchmarks](https://zenodo.org/records/10695186) [1] [are available from Zenodo. The Source Code](https://github.com/songyahui/infer_TempFix) [2] of the tool (ProveNFix) is
    22	[available from GitHub. The final version of the Paper](https://www.comp.nus.edu.sg/~yahuis/ProveNFix.pdf) [3] [and the Appendix](https://www.comp.nus.edu.sg/~yahuis/ProveNFix_tr.pdf) [4] are publicly accessible.
